(6646835, 992079, 49018, '<td valign="top">Or reflective :) Nice take. I am unsure about the painterly look to the image, but I guess it''s matter of taste. Also, rotating 180 deg or flipping could have made for an interesting image too, given the underexposure have preserved more sky details on the reflected scene.</td>', 'Or reflective :) Nice take. I am unsure about the painterly look to the image, but I guess it''s matter of taste. Also, rotating 180 deg or flipping could have made for an interesting image too, given the underexposure have preserved more sky details on the reflected scene.', '2012-01-16 16:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
