(6646849, 992657, 96751, '<td valign="top">This takes my breath away, Bear.  I love how the weeds in the water look like a signature :-)</td>', 'This takes my breath away, Bear.  I love how the weeds in the water look like a signature :-)', '2012-01-16 16:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646850, 992786, 49018, '<td valign="top">You wish to become a spider for Google? :)<br/>Interesting macro, I like that the web is quite evident and that the spider is evidently busy working on it. More detail would have helped as this is what people normally look for first thing in macros.</td>', 'You wish to become a spider for Google? :)Interesting macro, I like that the web is quite evident and that the spider is evidently busy working on it. More detail would have helped as this is what people normally look for first thing in macros.', '2012-01-16 16:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646851, 992996, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail</td>', 'Beautiful detail', '2012-01-16 16:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646853, 992639, 96751, '<td valign="top">Based on location and the expressed resolution, I''m going to have to guess this is MargaretN.</td>', 'Based on location and the expressed resolution, I''m going to have to guess this is MargaretN.', '2012-01-16 16:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646858, 993075, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and amusing. I see how the emphasys is on the eyes and the general hue of the image reflects this, but I wonder how it would work with more muted colours, or even BW or sepia. It would make for an image more reminiscent of surrealism, perhaps (not a criticism, just a passing thought)</td>', 'Nice idea and amusing. I see how the emphasys is on the eyes and the general hue of the image reflects this, but I wonder how it would work with more muted colours, or even BW or sepia. It would make for an image more reminiscent of surrealism, perhaps (not a criticism, just a passing thought)', '2012-01-16 16:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646865, 992963, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The fenced area looks a bit like a baby cot :)<br/>Unless you are suggesting that you wish to limit/quit because of an incoming baby (uhh, far fetched perhaps :)</td>', 'Nice idea. The fenced area looks a bit like a baby cot :)Unless you are suggesting that you wish to limit/quit because of an incoming baby (uhh, far fetched perhaps :)', '2012-01-16 16:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646866, 993025, 49018, '<td valign="top">Quite funny :)</td>', 'Quite funny :)', '2012-01-16 16:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646869, 992641, 49018, '<td valign="top">Ohh, very good start and an unusual shot. What are thy doing exactly? Courting?</td>', 'Ohh, very good start and an unusual shot. What are thy doing exactly? Courting?', '2012-01-16 16:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646877, 992658, 49018, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I like the DOF and how you captured the fragments, quite effective. I would have perhaps found it even more effective if the bottled was tilted further, 45 deg or thereabout. I find that it would give more impact as that''s how it would tend to land if thrown on an impulse rather than dropped. Then I understand that there are just so much bottles available to smash :)</td>', 'Good idea, I like the DOF and how you captured the fragments, quite effective. I would have perhaps found it even more effective if the bottled was tilted further, 45 deg or thereabout. I find that it would give more impact as that''s how it would tend to land if thrown on an impulse rather than dropped. Then I understand that there are just so much bottles available to smash :)', '2012-01-16 16:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646891, 992801, 49018, '<td valign="top">Is he brandishing a lighter, the little arsonist? :)</td>', 'Is he brandishing a lighter, the little arsonist? :)', '2012-01-16 16:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646900, 992718, 49018, '<td valign="top">Expressive.</td>', 'Expressive.', '2012-01-16 16:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646936, 992668, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting hue of the outside VS church, and the framing. There are a few things that, in my opinion, could have made the image more effective and self descriptive, even without any title.<br/>The hue of the church shows a bit yellowish, at least on my monitor, a slightly warmer cast would have made for a more inviting focal point to the image. Detail on the church could be better, perhaps a case for using a tripod. A framing or some element suggesting inquivocably that this is a church would have gone a long way makign the concept clear without any title. I am unsure about the inclusion of the house on the left, a crop exclusing it might simplify the image leaving only looming woods and church. Just my opinion, no offence taken I hope.</td>', 'I like the contrasting hue of the outside VS church, and the framing. There are a few things that, in my opinion, could have made the image more effective and self descriptive, even without any title.The hue of the church shows a bit yellowish, at least on my monitor, a slightly warmer cast would have made for a more inviting focal point to the image. Detail on the church could be better, perhaps a case for using a tripod. A framing or some element suggesting inquivocably that this is a church would have gone a long way makign the concept clear without any title. I am unsure about the inclusion of the house on the left, a crop exclusing it might simplify the image leaving only looming woods and church. Just my opinion, no offence taken I hope.', '2012-01-16 16:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646943, 993031, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the two ranges of tones and the detail. I find that brighter and more vibrant colours would have made for a more attractive image, if that was the intention.</td>', 'I like the two ranges of tones and the detail. I find that brighter and more vibrant colours would have made for a more attractive image, if that was the intention.', '2012-01-16 16:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6646946, 992822, 49018, '<td valign="top">Kung - Fu? I like the DOF and the general tones to the image, quite harmonious.</td>', 'Kung - Fu? I like the DOF and the general tones to the image, quite harmonious.', '2012-01-16 16:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
