(6647116, 992813, 49018, '<td valign="top">Funny :) Edible reward?<br/>It''s cute. With my display calibration the colours and image quality of the two images do not blend too much. Perhaps a bit less contrast on the ribbon, similar DOF between the images, a slight reflection of the squirrel on the ribbon and/or some corrective layers could have helped enhancing the illusion. But perhaps you wished to keep it as it is.<br/> <br/>[Edit: clarified, not two images but two distinct edits on the ribbon and the squirrel]</td>', 'Funny :) Edible reward?It''s cute. With my display calibration the colours and image quality of the two images do not blend too much. Perhaps a bit less contrast on the ribbon, similar DOF between the images, a slight reflection of the squirrel on the ribbon and/or some corrective layers could have helped enhancing the illusion. But perhaps you wished to keep it as it is. [Edit: clarified, not two images but two distinct edits on the ribbon and the squirrel]', '2012-01-16 19:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
