(6647926, 992838, 124982, '<td valign="top">Guessing this is a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a> entry? Like the idea, and the bike, but the composition is a little...stale? No real excitement to it. Maybe a close up of the bike showing off the details of the bike (eg. cogs/spokes/chains etc) would''ve bee a little more interesting?</td>', 'Guessing this is a  Yo_Spiff entry? Like the idea, and the bike, but the composition is a little...stale? No real excitement to it. Maybe a close up of the bike showing off the details of the bike (eg. cogs/spokes/chains etc) would''ve bee a little more interesting?', '2012-01-17 20:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
