(6648514, 992639, 135629, '<td valign="top">It seems like you were actually able to capture "light Itself" in this photograph, I gave it high marks! What could be different for a coveted 10 score: Possibly a little more vivid colors in the foreground, and the fact that the foreground is sharp but almost too grainy... like on the left where land meets clouds it almost looks like snowfall. That would be the only tech item I could point out, good luck in the challenge! I bet this area would make a neat tilt-shift shot too :)</td>', 'It seems like you were actually able to capture "light Itself" in this photograph, I gave it high marks! What could be different for a coveted 10 score: Possibly a little more vivid colors in the foreground, and the fact that the foreground is sharp but almost too grainy... like on the left where land meets clouds it almost looks like snowfall. That would be the only tech item I could point out, good luck in the challenge! I bet this area would make a neat tilt-shift shot too :)', '2012-01-18 10:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
