(6649041, 992992, 113142, '<td valign="top">I hate you and your lovely house. Abosutely hate you. (of course I don''t, and what a great goal. We all need to serve ourselves a <i>little</i> bit, don''t we?)</td>', 'I hate you and your lovely house. Abosutely hate you. (of course I don''t, and what a great goal. We all need to serve ourselves a little bit, don''t we?)', '2012-01-18 21:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649043, 992822, 113142, '<td valign="top">This makes me really wish I knew what that stuff was, and that should speak well for your image. DOF is well-controlled and obviously intentional so good job there, but it is so focused at the foreground corner that . . . idk maybe something intangible registers wrong in my brain.</td>', 'This makes me really wish I knew what that stuff was, and that should speak well for your image. DOF is well-controlled and obviously intentional so good job there, but it is so focused at the foreground corner that . . . idk maybe something intangible registers wrong in my brain.', '2012-01-18 21:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649046, 992911, 113142, '<td valign="top">This image suggests that you are on the right track (and, no, I''m not assuming that the juggler is you, just that you found the fun!) On a side note, you provided some (belated) inspiration for this challenge that I was struggling to express and ran out of time for. Along the same lines as far as the end goal, but an absolutely different type of spirit. Oh well.</td>', 'This image suggests that you are on the right track (and, no, I''m not assuming that the juggler is you, just that you found the fun!) On a side note, you provided some (belated) inspiration for this challenge that I was struggling to express and ran out of time for. Along the same lines as far as the end goal, but an absolutely different type of spirit. Oh well.', '2012-01-18 21:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649049, 992775, 113142, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing we''ll see a lot of these goals :) no harm! hmmm, this looks like it was taken through something and not just pp''d. Please share when the time comes. Without losing any modern sense, it reminds me of old-time movies where the lamp would provide uneven illumination of the nitrates . . . i especially like how the subject is looking very slightly up and to their right and not dead-on. gives excellent feeling of being intimately scrutinized.</td>', 'I''m guessing we''ll see a lot of these goals :) no harm! hmmm, this looks like it was taken through something and not just pp''d. Please share when the time comes. Without losing any modern sense, it reminds me of old-time movies where the lamp would provide uneven illumination of the nitrates . . . i especially like how the subject is looking very slightly up and to their right and not dead-on. gives excellent feeling of being intimately scrutinized.', '2012-01-18 21:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649052, 992623, 113142, '<td valign="top">Oh, come ON! old idea, sheesh, but nice execution!</td>', 'Oh, come ON! old idea, sheesh, but nice execution!', '2012-01-18 21:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649055, 992657, 113142, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the trees, but the halos around the swans brings my eyes down very quickly towards the somewhat noisy water. Arrgh, very tough to score this one! Those treeees! Just something about them, they MAKE this picture for me, I''m gonna steal it and crop out the birds! I know, that''s a pretty serious insult :) don''t worry, I wouldn''t dare do either!</td>', 'I LOVE the trees, but the halos around the swans brings my eyes down very quickly towards the somewhat noisy water. Arrgh, very tough to score this one! Those treeees! Just something about them, they MAKE this picture for me, I''m gonna steal it and crop out the birds! I know, that''s a pretty serious insult :) don''t worry, I wouldn''t dare do either!', '2012-01-18 21:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649056, 992811, 113142, '<td valign="top">Especially not with the wrong species :)</td>', 'Especially not with the wrong species :)', '2012-01-18 21:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649057, 992390, 113142, '<td valign="top">Too late!</td>', 'Too late!', '2012-01-18 21:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649058, 993025, 113142, '<td valign="top">What on EARTH were you wearing? the shirt, I get, but how your neck and arms and not your face nor hands? I got it! you went skiing in a tank-top! That''s ok, it''ll heal and you''ll forget by summer and it''ll happen allll over again.</td>', 'What on EARTH were you wearing? the shirt, I get, but how your neck and arms and not your face nor hands? I got it! you went skiing in a tank-top! That''s ok, it''ll heal and you''ll forget by summer and it''ll happen allll over again.', '2012-01-18 21:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649062, 993003, 113142, '<td valign="top">Personally, I could never balance my family and photography on outings. Try as I might, I would get distracted and do one of two things: I would linger too long while everyone else wanted/needed to move on or I would run away and leave them all behind wondering where I went! ADHD + family outings = me in doghouse! good luck!</td>', 'Personally, I could never balance my family and photography on outings. Try as I might, I would get distracted and do one of two things: I would linger too long while everyone else wanted/needed to move on or I would run away and leave them all behind wondering where I went! ADHD + family outings = me in doghouse! good luck!', '2012-01-18 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649069, 992732, 113142, '<td valign="top">Don''t bother.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>Oh, MAN! that would be so freakin'' mean if I meant it! Sorry, I couldn''t resist, but seriously this is pretty darn good :) the model has an interesting attitude about her, like "well, here i am. how do I look?" If that was what you were going for, then I''m glad for you! Now, I''m no expert so please correct me post challenge if I''m wrong, but it seems odd that her left arm is darker than her right, though seems to have the same contrast as the right. Is that on purpose? I got distracted by it.</td>', 'Don''t bother.     Oh, MAN! that would be so freakin'' mean if I meant it! Sorry, I couldn''t resist, but seriously this is pretty darn good :) the model has an interesting attitude about her, like "well, here i am. how do I look?" If that was what you were going for, then I''m glad for you! Now, I''m no expert so please correct me post challenge if I''m wrong, but it seems odd that her left arm is darker than her right, though seems to have the same contrast as the right. Is that on purpose? I got distracted by it.', '2012-01-18 21:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649074, 992613, 113142, '<td valign="top">Follow the yellow . . . i mean, err, red, brick, umm . . . colloid . . . road? no, vein? gah! I''m satisfyingly drawn toward the upper left into a leafy mystery cave! and that''s a compliment!</td>', 'Follow the yellow . . . i mean, err, red, brick, umm . . . colloid . . . road? no, vein? gah! I''m satisfyingly drawn toward the upper left into a leafy mystery cave! and that''s a compliment!', '2012-01-18 21:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649076, 993045, 113142, '<td valign="top">That lunch is a bit steep, whoo! Hope I get enough to keep me eating for the entire threeandahalf HOURS of lunch :) Hey, quick tip: best way to walk more is to just take the first parking spot that you see and just walk instead of drive around in circles for an hour. You save gas and get good exercise at the same time!</td>', 'That lunch is a bit steep, whoo! Hope I get enough to keep me eating for the entire threeandahalf HOURS of lunch :) Hey, quick tip: best way to walk more is to just take the first parking spot that you see and just walk instead of drive around in circles for an hour. You save gas and get good exercise at the same time!', '2012-01-18 21:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649078, 992801, 113142, '<td valign="top">Is that a banksey? Perfect placement! I wonder which was there first . . . unless YOU are he! quick! call the authorities!</td>', 'Is that a banksey? Perfect placement! I wonder which was there first . . . unless YOU are he! quick! call the authorities!', '2012-01-18 21:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649091, 993043, 113142, '<td valign="top">5..4...3....2.....1.. .  .    . the last second is always the slowest! It seems as though you had to re-shoot a few because your smirk kept ruining the look of surprise/fear :)</td>', '5..4...3....2.....1.. .  .    . the last second is always the slowest! It seems as though you had to re-shoot a few because your smirk kept ruining the look of surprise/fear :)', '2012-01-18 22:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649097, 992079, 113142, '<td valign="top">The vast, bright, new horizons concept, very well laid out. I''m thinking about how they are going to forget about their destination because of all the happenings on the way :)</td>', 'The vast, bright, new horizons concept, very well laid out. I''m thinking about how they are going to forget about their destination because of all the happenings on the way :)', '2012-01-18 22:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649102, 992903, 113142, '<td valign="top">...and run back inside! brrr! I will never cease to be fascinated by the vapor rising from water when it''s below freezing outside, and I''m educated in thermodynamics! Just goes to show, to know doesn''t remove the wonder :)</td>', '...and run back inside! brrr! I will never cease to be fascinated by the vapor rising from water when it''s below freezing outside, and I''m educated in thermodynamics! Just goes to show, to know doesn''t remove the wonder :)', '2012-01-18 22:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649104, 992898, 113142, '<td valign="top">Ah! Yes, good sir! It was to try every one on the shelf! What? I already did? WELL, if I don''t remember, then it didn''t happen and I''ll just have to do it, as you say, AGAIN!</td>', 'Ah! Yes, good sir! It was to try every one on the shelf! What? I already did? WELL, if I don''t remember, then it didn''t happen and I''ll just have to do it, as you say, AGAIN!', '2012-01-18 22:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649107, 992494, 113142, '<td valign="top">With your eyes closed! whooooooo! whoooooo!</td>', 'With your eyes closed! whooooooo! whoooooo!', '2012-01-18 22:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649109, 992953, 113142, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where yours is at, but if you ever have a chance to go to San Diego they''ve got great little markets like this, too. to critique, i''ll have to admit that this nice and colorful yet feels like a snapshot.</td>', 'I don''t know where yours is at, but if you ever have a chance to go to San Diego they''ve got great little markets like this, too. to critique, i''ll have to admit that this nice and colorful yet feels like a snapshot.', '2012-01-18 22:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649114, 992814, 113142, '<td valign="top">Unless you are in the southern hemisphere, you''ve GOT to be freezing right now. This has very good light, texture and subject but I feel that the center was not the place to go, facing away and to an angle that cut across the might have created an atmosphere of departure. You facing the camera gives the impression of a return from adventures already had, and the straight angle removes any possibility of motion.</td>', 'Unless you are in the southern hemisphere, you''ve GOT to be freezing right now. This has very good light, texture and subject but I feel that the center was not the place to go, facing away and to an angle that cut across the might have created an atmosphere of departure. You facing the camera gives the impression of a return from adventures already had, and the straight angle removes any possibility of motion.', '2012-01-18 22:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649121, 992963, 113142, '<td valign="top">I absolutely LOVE the incredibly dire and frank warnings on packs of cigarettes sold outside the states! the US market has a warning that is rather ineffectual in and of itself (vague), but is also somewhat camoflauged. For instance, my Pall Malls have a warning about containing carbon monoxide (ummm, if I were a person who didn''t know what CO was, then why the heck would I care?) and is printed in fine gold letters upon a green background (rather painful just to read, if you can find it in the first place!). Wow. I need to quit, too :)</td>', 'I absolutely LOVE the incredibly dire and frank warnings on packs of cigarettes sold outside the states! the US market has a warning that is rather ineffectual in and of itself (vague), but is also somewhat camoflauged. For instance, my Pall Malls have a warning about containing carbon monoxide (ummm, if I were a person who didn''t know what CO was, then why the heck would I care?) and is printed in fine gold letters upon a green background (rather painful just to read, if you can find it in the first place!). Wow. I need to quit, too :)', '2012-01-18 22:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649126, 993026, 113142, '<td valign="top">Please please PLEASE tell me that you helped this person, I''m biting my toungue because of the foible i tripped upon when lambasting ubique''s Garbage challenge! Maybe you can donate this photo to the food bank? idk, just a suggestion, gotta get the word out that america needs to help itself before it can even be ABLE to help others. Shout out to the little guys: (emphasis to point out the proper quote of an often misspoken phrase) It is the <i><b>love of</b></i> money that is the root of all evil</td>', 'Please please PLEASE tell me that you helped this person, I''m biting my toungue because of the foible i tripped upon when lambasting ubique''s Garbage challenge! Maybe you can donate this photo to the food bank? idk, just a suggestion, gotta get the word out that america needs to help itself before it can even be ABLE to help others. Shout out to the little guys: (emphasis to point out the proper quote of an often misspoken phrase) It is the love of money that is the root of all evil', '2012-01-18 22:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
