(6649161, 992869, 113142, '<td valign="top">Ironically, I think that if the cigarette was lit that would have worked well with the picture and idea . . . something about it being unlit gives an uneasy feeling of anticipation that smoking is about to BEGIN. Of course, that might be your whole point, to demonstrate the perpetual anticipation that accompanies addiction. I like.</td>', 'Ironically, I think that if the cigarette was lit that would have worked well with the picture and idea . . . something about it being unlit gives an uneasy feeling of anticipation that smoking is about to BEGIN. Of course, that might be your whole point, to demonstrate the perpetual anticipation that accompanies addiction. I like.', '2012-01-18 23:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649163, 993067, 113142, '<td valign="top">oooohhh, cringe, not through the window, ach! very unfortunate, you lost a tremendous amount of detail just under the sun that would have been visible if not for the dirty glass, not to mention the irregularities of the suns "halo"</td>', 'oooohhh, cringe, not through the window, ach! very unfortunate, you lost a tremendous amount of detail just under the sun that would have been visible if not for the dirty glass, not to mention the irregularities of the suns "halo"', '2012-01-18 23:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
