(6649783, 992717, 113142, '<td valign="top">Thank god for avanced editing! else i don''t think you could''ve pulled this together! Seriously, though, this is one of those that I can''t judge on first take. I gotta come back like two or three times, asceticism does not take immediate root with me . . .and the question mark is throwing me off :)<br/> <br/>After another look, I realized that this definitely has merit because it got me wanting to come back and to think about it, but I can''t help but wonder if that is due to the context of the challenge not specifically being met by this entry which is unquestionably unique compared to the other submissions. So yes it has transient quality properties, but I doubt that I would be all that thoughtful about it if it were on its own. Good job, though, bc sometimes success is all about being different than contemporaries even at the sacrifice of actual content.</td>', 'Thank god for avanced editing! else i don''t think you could''ve pulled this together! Seriously, though, this is one of those that I can''t judge on first take. I gotta come back like two or three times, asceticism does not take immediate root with me . . .and the question mark is throwing me off :) After another look, I realized that this definitely has merit because it got me wanting to come back and to think about it, but I can''t help but wonder if that is due to the context of the challenge not specifically being met by this entry which is unquestionably unique compared to the other submissions. So yes it has transient quality properties, but I doubt that I would be all that thoughtful about it if it were on its own. Good job, though, bc sometimes success is all about being different than contemporaries even at the sacrifice of actual content.', '2012-01-19 18:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
