(6651897, 992079, 30049, '<td valign="top">Missed the focal point.  Better impact IMO if either the water reflection was in focus or the guys themselves.  The noise reduction use made the guys unnaturally smoothed out "plastic" looking.  Right idea...just lost a little on the execution.</td>', 'Missed the focal point.  Better impact IMO if either the water reflection was in focus or the guys themselves.  The noise reduction use made the guys unnaturally smoothed out "plastic" looking.  Right idea...just lost a little on the execution.', '2012-01-22 13:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
