(6652560, 992935, 75713, '<td valign="top">I knew this was you you daring woman ... loved it and it made me laugh out loud (which I don''t do often) and I marveled at the creativity and the excellent manner you carried out your vision.  I gave you a 9 - in retrospect it should have been a 10 - thanks for the laugh and the honesty.</td>', 'I knew this was you you daring woman ... loved it and it made me laugh out loud (which I don''t do often) and I marveled at the creativity and the excellent manner you carried out your vision.  I gave you a 9 - in retrospect it should have been a 10 - thanks for the laugh and the honesty.', '2012-01-23 02:03:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6652561, 992641, 75713, '<td valign="top">One of the most difficult shots in wildlife photography is to catch a shot that is unusual .. this is unusual and for that reason alone a lot of the rules are dismissed .. you didn''t need to get the catch light in their eyes - or even show their heads .. it''s a unique shot in it''s composition and so deserving of a ribbon.</td>', 'One of the most difficult shots in wildlife photography is to catch a shot that is unusual .. this is unusual and for that reason alone a lot of the rules are dismissed .. you didn''t need to get the catch light in their eyes - or even show their heads .. it''s a unique shot in it''s composition and so deserving of a ribbon.', '2012-01-23 02:06:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6652562, 992902, 75713, '<td valign="top">OMG!! Too funny and so well photographed ... should have been a higher score but for some strange reason no one has appointed me the supreme being yet :)</td>', 'OMG!! Too funny and so well photographed ... should have been a higher score but for some strange reason no one has appointed me the supreme being yet :)', '2012-01-23 02:09:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6652563, 992996, 119863, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried doing droplet shots on flowers time and time again and this is a perfect representation of what I am hoping it will come out like, although it always falls short.  Great DOF, fantastic sharpness.  I would love for this photo to be in the "How''d They Do That" section, because I really want to learn how this was done.  I''m guessing plentiful lighting was key, for the reflections on the drops and also to allow a high f-stop without getting noisy.  wonderful photo.</td>', 'I''ve tried doing droplet shots on flowers time and time again and this is a perfect representation of what I am hoping it will come out like, although it always falls short.  Great DOF, fantastic sharpness.  I would love for this photo to be in the "How''d They Do That" section, because I really want to learn how this was done.  I''m guessing plentiful lighting was key, for the reflections on the drops and also to allow a high f-stop without getting noisy.  wonderful photo.', '2012-01-23 02:23:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6652582, 992811, 20799, '<td valign="top">One of my two top picks. Fantastic catch!</td>', 'One of my two top picks. Fantastic catch!', '2012-01-23 02:56:02.000000', NULL, 0),
