(6652664, 992641, 103142, '<td valign="top">What a truly incredible capture!! When I first saw it, all I could say was "whoa!", and it''s still my reaction each time I see it.<br/> <br/>Spectacular shot, spectacular capture, well deserved ribbon! What a way to start your ribbon collection. :D</td>', 'What a truly incredible capture!! When I first saw it, all I could say was "whoa!", and it''s still my reaction each time I see it. Spectacular shot, spectacular capture, well deserved ribbon! What a way to start your ribbon collection. :D', '2012-01-23 07:13:15.000000', NULL, 0),
