(6652676, 992996, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m really not fond of droplet on rose shots. They''re done so often, and there''s not much that''s special about them.<br/> <br/>That being said...<br/> <br/><i>This is truly spectacular!</i> <br/> <br/>The rose looks velvety, the drops are perfectly lit and just glow. Beautifully done -- congrats on the top 10. :)</td>', 'I''m really not fond of droplet on rose shots. They''re done so often, and there''s not much that''s special about them. That being said... This is truly spectacular!  The rose looks velvety, the drops are perfectly lit and just glow. Beautifully done -- congrats on the top 10. :)', '2012-01-23 07:26:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6652678, 992814, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the processing on this -- the softness is interesting. Seems a tad dark -- I can''t tell if it adds to the moodiness, or just seems dark. But it''s still very nicely done! Congrats on the top 10!</td>', 'I like the processing on this -- the softness is interesting. Seems a tad dark -- I can''t tell if it adds to the moodiness, or just seems dark. But it''s still very nicely done! Congrats on the top 10!', '2012-01-23 07:27:17.000000', NULL, 0),
