(6652702, 992494, 20799, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mood in this one, I love it!</td>', 'Wonderful mood in this one, I love it!', '2012-01-23 08:15:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6652723, 992717, 86218, '<td valign="top">Goodness me. Having gone through all the images.. I find myself HAVING to comment on this. Commenting ont his and the toughts going through my mind is almost as looking at this image and trying to process it. <br/> <br/>What should fill my mind..what does fill my mind.. The diversity of thoughts from different viewers is really what get''s my attention.. What did the next person think about when they looked at this. If It was simply looking at this and saying..there''s no image, then certainly there was no thoughts as to the intent or what the image means to you personally.<br/>Not a cloud Nothing...empty clear.. Not a single object at the point of thirds... a plane maybe?... NO<br/> <br/>It''s clean as a whistle..and Im even finding myself trying to find a dust bunny...but no..it''s clean. Looking at this is so refreshing since I normally shoot this to identify and clean my sensor... but time again Im confronted with the dust spot having moved elsewhere instead of being blue like this. To the avid digital photographer as perfectionist..this is the ultimate optimism... <br/> <br/>Many other thoughts but let''s keep it at that. Certainly an image that can take you on a journey of thoughts so diverse..that if you had to place an object in it.. it would be prejudiced...</td>', 'Goodness me. Having gone through all the images.. I find myself HAVING to comment on this. Commenting ont his and the toughts going through my mind is almost as looking at this image and trying to process it.  What should fill my mind..what does fill my mind.. The diversity of thoughts from different viewers is really what get''s my attention.. What did the next person think about when they looked at this. If It was simply looking at this and saying..there''s no image, then certainly there was no thoughts as to the intent or what the image means to you personally.Not a cloud Nothing...empty clear.. Not a single object at the point of thirds... a plane maybe?... NO It''s clean as a whistle..and Im even finding myself trying to find a dust bunny...but no..it''s clean. Looking at this is so refreshing since I normally shoot this to identify and clean my sensor... but time again Im confronted with the dust spot having moved elsewhere instead of being blue like this. To the avid digital photographer as perfectionist..this is the ultimate optimism...  Many other thoughts but let''s keep it at that. Certainly an image that can take you on a journey of thoughts so diverse..that if you had to place an object in it.. it would be prejudiced...', '2012-01-23 08:59:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6652731, 992657, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely processing. Will look forward to seeing  your lovely landscapes in the future then.</td>', 'Lovely processing. Will look forward to seeing  your lovely landscapes in the future then.', '2012-01-23 09:04:00.000000', NULL, 0),
