(6652789, 992592, 65319, '<td valign="top">Wow...the expression on his face is priceless!  I''m surprised not to see this one on the front page!  Well done, Johanna!</td>', 'Wow...the expression on his face is priceless!  I''m surprised not to see this one on the front page!  Well done, Johanna!', '2012-01-23 09:58:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6652803, 992811, 19825, '<td valign="top">I should have recognized the model. Gap seems well named. He appears to stick his nose in every gap he finds. Nice capture and congrats on the top ten.</td>', 'I should have recognized the model. Gap seems well named. He appears to stick his nose in every gap he finds. Nice capture and congrats on the top ten.', '2012-01-23 10:21:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6652807, 992911, 39184, '<td valign="top">This image is way too sharp!  It appears to have been edited on a 55" monitor and, therefore, displays poorly on my mini 22" widescreen monitor.  The lack of interesting characters in the background is also disappointing.  Surely you could have captured someone in the crowd also taking pictures, even better if they were shooting with a Nikon ;)<br/> <br/>This is one of the values of get togethers.  I wouldn''t have thought to enter this scene into a challenge or that it would have done so well.  I mentioned to you all that morning that I probably wouldn''t be taking too many shots because urban areas are places in which I just don''t see the possibilities.  I''m much more in my element lost in the countryside, wilderness, or desolate beaches.<br/> <br/>It''s eye opening for me to see a shot from our GTG do so well.  I''m sure that I''ll remember this whenever I''m in urban areas with a camera.<br/> <br/>Great job and congratulations!</td>', 'This image is way too sharp!  It appears to have been edited on a 55" monitor and, therefore, displays poorly on my mini 22" widescreen monitor.  The lack of interesting characters in the background is also disappointing.  Surely you could have captured someone in the crowd also taking pictures, even better if they were shooting with a Nikon ;) This is one of the values of get togethers.  I wouldn''t have thought to enter this scene into a challenge or that it would have done so well.  I mentioned to you all that morning that I probably wouldn''t be taking too many shots because urban areas are places in which I just don''t see the possibilities.  I''m much more in my element lost in the countryside, wilderness, or desolate beaches. It''s eye opening for me to see a shot from our GTG do so well.  I''m sure that I''ll remember this whenever I''m in urban areas with a camera. Great job and congratulations!', '2012-01-23 10:23:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6652811, 993026, 39184, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Another good finish from the images of our GTG.  As I mentioned to Cory, I didn''t see the possibilities but you did.  Congrats.</td>', 'Wow.  Another good finish from the images of our GTG.  As I mentioned to Cory, I didn''t see the possibilities but you did.  Congrats.', '2012-01-23 10:25:02.000000', NULL, 0),
