(6653037, 992732, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dali_lama_2k:</b></div><hr/><i>I''m no expert so please correct me post challenge if I''m wrong, but it seems odd that her left arm is darker than her right, though seems to have the same contrast as the right. Is that on purpose? I got distracted by it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The softbox light is hitting her from left (her right) and I have a giant white board on the right serving as a reflector so naturally the side that the softbox is closer to will be brighter than her other side.</td>', 'Originally posted by dali_lama_2k:I''m no expert so please correct me post challenge if I''m wrong, but it seems odd that her left arm is darker than her right, though seems to have the same contrast as the right. Is that on purpose? I got distracted by it.   The softbox light is hitting her from left (her right) and I have a giant white board on the right serving as a reflector so naturally the side that the softbox is closer to will be brighter than her other side.', '2012-01-23 14:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
